>  static struct platform_driver scpi_cpufreq_platdrv = {
>  	.driver = {
> -		.name	= "scpi-cpufreq",
> -		.owner	= THIS_MODULE,
> +		.name	= "scpi-cpufreq"

You don't need to remove the comma.  There was a trailing comma
originally, so you may as well leave that.

julia

